"User app caches" = "Cache aplikasi pengguna";
"Temporary data apps keep to load faster. Apps recreate it automatically when needed." = "Data sementara yang disimpan aplikasi agar lebih cepat dimuat. Aplikasi membuatnya ulang otomatis saat diperlukan.";
"Some apps may start a little slower the first time" = "Beberapa aplikasi mungkin sedikit lebih lambat saat pertama dibuka";
"User logs & crash reports" = "Log & laporan crash pengguna";
"Diagnostic text files written by apps. Only needed when you are reporting a bug." = "File teks diagnostik yang ditulis aplikasi. Hanya diperlukan saat Anda melaporkan bug.";
"Safari cache" = "Cache Safari";
"Copies of web pages and images. Safari downloads them again when you visit a site. History, bookmarks and logins are not touched." = "Salinan halaman web dan gambar. Safari mengunduhnya lagi saat Anda mengunjungi situs. Riwayat, bookmark, dan login tidak disentuh.";
"Google Chrome cache" = "Cache Google Chrome";
"Copies of web pages and images. Chrome downloads them again when you visit a site. History, bookmarks and logins are not touched." = "Salinan halaman web dan gambar. Chrome mengunduhnya lagi saat Anda mengunjungi situs. Riwayat, bookmark, dan login tidak disentuh.";
"Trash" = "Tong Sampah";
"Files you already moved to the Trash. They stay restorable from the Restore Center for the retention period." = "File yang sudah Anda pindahkan ke Tong Sampah. File tetap bisa dipulihkan dari Pusat Pemulihan selama masa simpan.";
"Xcode DerivedData" = "DerivedData Xcode";
"Build intermediates and indexes. Xcode rebuilds them on the next build." = "File antara build dan indeks. Xcode membuatnya ulang pada build berikutnya.";
"Next build and indexing take longer" = "Build dan pengindeksan berikutnya lebih lama";
"iOS DeviceSupport" = "iOS DeviceSupport";
"Debug symbols copied from devices you connected. Xcode copies them again the next time you debug on that device and OS version." = "Simbol debug yang disalin dari perangkat yang pernah Anda sambungkan. Xcode menyalinnya lagi saat Anda men-debug di perangkat dan versi OS itu.";
"Reconnecting a device takes several minutes" = "Menyambungkan ulang perangkat butuh beberapa menit";
"Simulator caches" = "Cache simulator";
"Cached data for iOS simulators (dyld and runtime caches). Simulators rebuild it on next launch. Your simulator apps and data are not touched." = "Data cache untuk simulator iOS (cache dyld dan runtime). Simulator membuatnya ulang saat dibuka berikutnya. Aplikasi dan data simulator Anda tidak disentuh.";
"Homebrew downloads" = "Unduhan Homebrew";
"Downloaded bottles and source archives. Homebrew downloads them again if it needs them. Installed packages are not touched." = "Bottle dan arsip sumber yang diunduh. Homebrew mengunduhnya lagi jika diperlukan. Package yang terpasang tidak disentuh.";
"npm cache" = "Cache npm";
"npm's download cache. Packages are fetched again on the next install. Your projects' node_modules are not touched." = "Cache unduhan npm. Package diambil lagi saat instalasi berikutnya. node_modules di proyek Anda tidak disentuh.";
"Next npm install downloads packages again" = "npm install berikutnya mengunduh package lagi";
"Yarn cache" = "Cache Yarn";
"Yarn's download cache. Packages are fetched again on the next install." = "Cache unduhan Yarn. Package diambil lagi saat instalasi berikutnya.";
"pip cache" = "Cache pip";
"pip's download and wheel cache. Packages are fetched again on the next install. Installed packages and virtual environments are not touched." = "Cache unduhan dan wheel pip. Package diambil lagi saat instalasi berikutnya. Package yang terpasang dan virtual environment tidak disentuh.";
"CocoaPods cache" = "Cache CocoaPods";
"Downloaded pod sources. CocoaPods fetches them again on the next pod install." = "Sumber pod yang diunduh. CocoaPods mengambilnya lagi saat pod install berikutnya.";
"Go build cache" = "Cache build Go";
"Compiled Go packages. Go rebuilds them on the next build." = "Package Go yang sudah dikompilasi. Go membuatnya ulang pada build berikutnya.";
"Cargo registry downloads" = "Unduhan registry Cargo";
"Downloaded crate archives. Cargo downloads them again when a build needs them." = "Arsip crate yang diunduh. Cargo mengunduhnya lagi saat build memerlukannya.";
"Gradle caches" = "Cache Gradle";
"Downloaded dependencies and build caches. Gradle fetches them again, which can take a long time on big projects." = "Dependensi yang diunduh dan cache build. Gradle mengambilnya lagi, yang bisa lama di proyek besar.";
"Next Gradle build downloads dependencies again" = "Build Gradle berikutnya mengunduh dependensi lagi";

/* Project build folders */
"node_modules in inactive projects" = "node_modules di proyek yang tidak aktif";
"Packages installed into a JavaScript project you haven't changed for 30 days. Your code isn't touched. Run npm install (or yarn, pnpm, bun) in the project to get them back." = "Paket yang terpasang di proyek JavaScript yang tidak Anda ubah selama 30 hari. Kode Anda tidak disentuh. Jalankan npm install (atau yarn, pnpm, bun) di proyek itu untuk memasangnya lagi.";
"Next install in that project downloads the packages again" = "Instalasi berikutnya di proyek itu mengunduh paketnya lagi";
"Web framework build caches" = "Cache build framework web";
"Build output and caches from Next.js, Nuxt, SvelteKit, Turborepo and Parcel in projects you haven't changed for 30 days. They're rebuilt on the next dev or build run." = "Hasil build dan cache dari Next.js, Nuxt, SvelteKit, Turborepo, dan Parcel di proyek yang tidak Anda ubah selama 30 hari. Semuanya dibuat ulang saat dev atau build berikutnya.";
"Next build of that project takes longer" = "Build berikutnya untuk proyek itu lebih lama";
"Rust and Maven target folders" = "Folder target Rust dan Maven";
"Compiled output of Rust (Cargo) and Java (Maven) projects you haven't changed for 30 days. cargo build or mvn package recreates it." = "Hasil kompilasi proyek Rust (Cargo) dan Java (Maven) yang tidak Anda ubah selama 30 hari. cargo build atau mvn package membuatnya ulang.";
"Next build compiles the project from scratch" = "Build berikutnya mengompilasi proyek dari awal";
"Swift package .build folders" = "Folder .build paket Swift";
"Build products and downloaded dependencies of Swift packages you haven't changed for 30 days. swift build recreates them." = "Hasil build dan dependensi yang diunduh untuk paket Swift yang tidak Anda ubah selama 30 hari. swift build membuatnya ulang.";
"Next build resolves and compiles everything again" = "Build berikutnya mengunduh dan mengompilasi semuanya lagi";
"Gradle build folders" = "Folder build Gradle";
"Build output and Gradle's project cache in Android and Java projects you haven't changed for 30 days. The next Gradle build recreates them." = "Hasil build dan cache proyek Gradle di proyek Android dan Java yang tidak Anda ubah selama 30 hari. Build Gradle berikutnya membuatnya ulang.";
"CocoaPods Pods folders" = "Folder Pods CocoaPods";
"Pods installed into iOS and macOS projects you haven't changed for 30 days. Run pod install in the project to get them back. Folders committed to Git are never offered." = "Pod yang terpasang di proyek iOS dan macOS yang tidak Anda ubah selama 30 hari. Jalankan pod install di proyek itu untuk memasangnya lagi. Folder yang di-commit ke Git tidak pernah ditawarkan.";
"pod install downloads the pods again" = "pod install mengunduh pod-nya lagi";
"Python virtual environments" = "Virtual environment Python";
"Virtual environments in Python projects you haven't changed for 30 days. Recreate one with python -m venv and reinstall the project's requirements." = "Virtual environment di proyek Python yang tidak Anda ubah selama 30 hari. Buat ulang dengan python -m venv, lalu pasang lagi kebutuhan proyeknya.";
"You'll need to recreate the environment and reinstall packages" = "Anda perlu membuat ulang environment dan memasang paketnya lagi";

/* Mail, preferences and Photos */
"Mail attachment copies" = "Salinan lampiran Mail";
"Copies of attachments you opened or previewed in Mail. The originals stay in your mailboxes, and Mail makes a new copy the next time you open one." = "Salinan lampiran yang pernah Anda buka atau pratinjau di Mail. Aslinya tetap ada di kotak surat, dan Mail membuat salinan baru saat Anda membukanya lagi.";
"Broken preference files" = "File preferensi rusak";
"Settings files that are empty or damaged, so their app can't read them anyway. The app starts with default settings and saves a fresh file. Apple's own settings are never included." = "File pengaturan yang kosong atau rusak, sehingga aplikasinya memang tidak bisa membacanya. Aplikasi akan mulai dengan pengaturan bawaan dan menyimpan file baru. Pengaturan milik Apple tidak pernah disertakan.";
"That app's settings go back to their defaults" = "Pengaturan aplikasi itu kembali ke bawaan";
"Photos analysis caches" = "Cache analisis Foto";
"Working files from the background analysis that recognises faces, scenes and text in your photos. They are rebuilt as needed. Your photos, albums and the analysis results in your library are not touched." = "File kerja dari analisis latar belakang yang mengenali wajah, pemandangan, dan teks di foto Anda. File ini dibuat ulang saat diperlukan. Foto, album, dan hasil analisis di perpustakaan Anda tidak disentuh.";
"Photos may re-analyse in the background for a while" = "Foto mungkin menganalisis ulang di latar belakang untuk sementara";
